-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SECTION 6 — PROCESS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No dependency is added without ALL of the following
(docs/contributing.md section 7):

  1. Licence identified by SPDX id, with upstream text vendored at
     third_party/<name>/LICENSE
  2. A verdict recorded in docs/file-format-support.md section 7.1
  3. Pinned by commit hash AND SHA-256, both verified at configure time
  4. An entry in this file
  5. Static-linking and iOS-distribution compatibility confirmed
  6. A named owner responsible for tracking its CVEs
  7. third_party/<name>/METADATA.yaml with name, version, SPDX id, upstream URL,
     owner, and any patches applied
  8. For dual-licensed or weak-copyleft components: an explicit record of which
     licence we elect, and why
  9. Binary-size impact measured and stated

A CycloneDX SBOM is generated per release build from the actual link graph.

